-1.mp4" style="border:0px #ffffff none;" name="MyVideo" scrolling="yes" frameborder="1" marginheight="0px" marginwidth="0px" height="180px" width="100%" controlslist="nodownload" autoplay controls></video>\n                </div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-name",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83e\uddfe</p>\n          Click on your name to visit your student profile page. It consists of all your achievements \ud83c\udfc6</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-points",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83c\udfaf</p>This is your total points received for each action taken on the dashboard. Click on the " i " button to know about points system</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-rank",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83e\udd47</p>This is your World Ranking. Its on basis of the submissions that you complete on the dashboard.</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-leaderboard",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83c\udfc6</p>Welcome to the All Time Leaderboard of Codingal. Compete among your fellow friends and rise above the rankings.</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-weeklyTarget",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83d\ude80</p>This card helps you track your weekly achievement of targets. Take more classes and submit more projects & quizzes to complete it within deadline.</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-joinClass",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\udcbb</p>You can join your coding class by clicking on this "Join Class" Button</div>'},{element:".intro-student-profile-doubtSession",intro:'<div class="flex items-center">\n          <p class="text-5xl pr-2">\ud83d\udca1</p>Hey got doubts in coding? Join this link to discuss your doubts with our Computer Science 